## 🔎 Overview

**asohCloak** is the identity and access management backbone for a modern school management platform — covering **course management, admissions, and payments**. It centralizes authentication, authorization, and identity federation for users, internal clients, and third-party API consumers through **Keycloak**.

> **asohCloak is the identity & access layer only.** It authenticates and authorizes — it does not own academic, admissions, or financial records. Those remain the responsibility of their respective domain services. This principle governs every architectural decision in this codebase.

| Domain | Owner | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| **Identity & Access** (this backend) | asohCloak | Authentication, authorization, OTP, magic links, Google login, rate limiting, token issuance, RBAC |
| **Academics** | External / Domain service | Courses, tags, enrollment |
| **Admissions & Payments** | External / Domain service | Applications, invoicing, receipts |

---

## 🏗️ Architectural Principle

**One Identity Source, One Truth.** There must be no second authentication or authorization ledger inside asohCloak. Keycloak remains the authoritative identity provider at every integration boundary — including error recovery, manual intervention, and performance optimization.

```
Client / Access Layer     → Web Portal, Mobile App, Admin Console (no auth logic)
API Gateway                → Rate limiting (Bucket4j), request validation
asohCloak                   → This backend — auth, OTP, magic link, Google login, RBAC
Downstream Systems           → Keycloak (identity), Course/Admissions/Payments services
```

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Language** | Java 25 |
| **Framework** | Spring Boot 4.1.1 |
| **ORM / Database** | PostgreSQL 18 via Hibernate & Spring Data JPA |
| **Migrations** | Flyway |
| **Identity / Auth** | Keycloak (OAuth2 Resource Server, JWT) |
| **Federated Login** | Firebase Admin API (Google Sign-In) |
| **Object Mapping** | MapStruct |
| **Boilerplate Reduction** | Lombok |
| **Event Streaming** | Kafka |
| **Caching** | Redis |
| **Rate Limiting** | Bucket4j |
| **Email Delivery** | Resend |
| **Document Generation** | Apache PDFBox |
| **API Docs** | OpenAPI / Swagger |
| **Containerization** | Docker |
| **Build Tool** | Maven / Gradle |

